        <div class="spec">.badge · .875em · .25em .6em · inline-block, baseline · primary, secondary, warning, danger and yellow fills are gradients, like buttons; dark, stripe and payment badges are flat</div>
      </div>
      <table class="table table-sm mb-0">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Class</th><th>Means</th><th>As used</th></tr>
        </thead>
